{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Module 04 — ESM-2 Protein Embeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Generate mean-pooled ESM-2 embeddings for phiL7 receptor-binding protein (RBP) candidates and Xcc host receptors. These embeddings feed Module 06 (deep ensemble regressor).\n",
    "\n",
    "**目的：** 使用 ESM-2 为 phiL7 受体结合蛋白（RBP）候选序列和 Xcc 宿主受体生成均值池化嵌入向量，供 Module 06（深度集成回归器）使用。\n",
    "\n",
    "**Reference / 参考文献:**\n",
    "- Lin, Z. et al. (2023) "Evolutionary-scale prediction of atomic-level protein structure." *Science* 379(6637):1123-1130. DOI: [10.1126/science.ade2574](https://doi.org/10.1126/science.ade2574)\n",
    "- Hie, B.L. et al. (2024) "Efficient evolution of human antibodies from general protein language models." *Nat Biotechnol.* (Demonstrates ESM transfer to non-canonical protein families.)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Output contract (INTERFACE.md §Module 04):**\n",
    "\n",
    "`.npz` required keys:\n",
    "| Key | Type | Shape |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `seq_ids` | object (str) | (N,) |\n",
    "| `array` | float32 | (N, embed_dim) |\n",
    "| `lengths` | int32 | (N,) — residue counts, no BOS/EOS |\n",
    "| `meta` | str (JSON) | scalar |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 2: imports, versions, seeds\n",
    "# 第 2 格：导入库、打印版本、固定随机种子\n",
    "import random\n",
    "import json\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "import esm\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "from Bio import SeqIO\n",
    "\n",
    "# Fix all random seeds / 固定所有随机种子\n",
    "SEED = 42\n",
    "random.seed(SEED)\n",
    "np.random.seed(SEED)\n",
    "torch.manual_seed(SEED)\n",
    "\n",
    "# REPO_ROOT anchored from notebook location / 以 notebook 位置锚定仓库根目录\n",
    "# notebooks live in <module>/processes/ → parents[1] = repo root\n",
    "REPO_ROOT = Path.cwd().resolve().parents[1]\n",
    "MODULE_DIR = REPO_ROOT / '04_protein_embedding'\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, str(MODULE_DIR / 'processes'))\n",
    "\n",
    "from esm2_utils import load_model, embed_sequences, save_npz, load_fasta\n",
    "\n",
    "print('REPO_ROOT:', REPO_ROOT)\n",
    "print('ESM version :', esm.__version__)\n",
    "print('torch version:', torch.__version__)\n",
    "print('numpy version:', np.__version__)\n",
    "print('pandas version:', pd.__version__)\n",
    "print('CUDA available:', torch.cuda.is_available())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Model Menu / 模型选单\n",
    "\n",
    "Select the appropriate ESM-2 model for your compute environment.\n",
    "根据计算环境选择合适的 ESM-2 模型。\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model | Layers | Embed dim | Params | GPU memory | Use for |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `esm2_t6_8M_UR50D` | 6 | 320 | 8 M | < 1 GB | CPU smoke / unit tests / Mac 本地测试 |\n",
    "| `esm2_t12_35M_UR50D` | 12 | 480 | 35 M | 2 GB | Laptop GPU |\n",
    "| `esm2_t30_150M_UR50D` | 30 | 640 | 150 M | 4 GB | Single small GPU |\n",
    "| `esm2_t33_650M_UR50D` | 33 | 1280 | 650 M | 12 GB | Production default / Laguna A100 |\n",
    "| `esm2_t36_3B_UR50D` | 36 | 2560 | 3 B | 24 GB | Laguna A100 (max accuracy) |\n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ **Do NOT run 650M or 3B on Mac CPU** — will OOM or take hours.\n",
    "> ⚠️ **请勿在 Mac CPU 上运行 650M 或 3B 模型** — 会 OOM 或跑几小时。\n",
    "\n",
    "See `LAGUNA.md` Template A for the SLURM script that runs 650M on an A100."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 4: model selector\n",
    "# 第 4 格：选择模型\n",
    "\n",
    "# Change to 'esm2_t33_650M_UR50D' on Laguna / 在 Laguna 上改为 650M\n",
    "MODEL_NAME = 'esm2_t6_8M_UR50D'  # CPU-safe default / CPU 安全默认值\n",
    "\n",
    "model, alphabet = load_model(MODEL_NAME)\n",
    "print(f'Model: {MODEL_NAME}')\n",
    "print(f'  embed_dim = {model.embed_dim}')\n",
    "print(f'  num_layers = {model.num_layers}')\n",
    "print(f'  device = {next(model.parameters()).device}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 5: embed_sequences helper (imported from esm2_utils)\n",
    "# 第 5 格：调用 esm2_utils 中的 embed_sequences\n",
    "# Token layout:\n",
    "#   pos 0   → BOS (<cls>)    excluded from pooling / 不参与均值\n",
    "#   pos 1…L → amino acids     mean-pooled here / 在此取均值\n",
    "#   pos L+1 → EOS (<eos>)    excluded from pooling / 不参与均值\n",
    "#   pos L+2… → PAD           excluded by length mask / 由 lengths 排除\n",
    "\n",
    "# The helper in esm2_utils.py slices token_reps[j, 1:L+1, :] for each sequence.\n",
    "# esm2_utils.py 中的辅助函数对每条序列取 token_reps[j, 1:L+1, :]。\n",
    "help(embed_sequences)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 6: save_npz helper\n",
    "# 第 6 格：save_npz 辅助函数\n",
    "help(save_npz)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## phiL7 RBP Embedding / phiL7 RBP 嵌入\n",
    "\n",
    "Read the top-K RBP candidates produced by Module 03. If Module 03 output is not yet available (Cycle 0 overnight build), fall back to `inputs/mock_phiL7_rbp_sequences.faa`.\n",
    "\n",
    "读取 Module 03 输出的前 K 个 RBP 候选。若 Module 03 尚未产出，使用 `inputs/mock_phiL7_rbp_sequences.faa` 作为回退（Cycle 0 一夜构建）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 8: load phiL7 RBP sequences (with Module 03 fallback)\n",
    "# 第 8 格：加载 phiL7 RBP 序列（如上游未就绪则使用 mock 回退）\n",
    "UPSTREAM_RBP = REPO_ROOT / '03_rbp_identification' / 'outputs' / 'EU717894.1_rbp_sequences.faa'\n",
    "MOCK_RBP     = MODULE_DIR / 'inputs' / 'mock_phiL7_rbp_sequences.faa'\n",
    "\n",
    "if UPSTREAM_RBP.exists():\n",
    "    rbp_path = UPSTREAM_RBP\n",
    "    print('Using upstream Module 03 output / 使用上游 Module 03 输出')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    rbp_path = MOCK_RBP\n",
    "    print('WARNING: Module 03 output not found — using mock sequences / 警告：使用 mock 序列')\n",
    "\n",
    "rbp_seqs = load_fasta(rbp_path)\n",
    "print(f'Loaded {len(rbp_seqs)} RBP sequences from {rbp_path.name}')\n",
    "for sid, seq in rbp_seqs:\n",
    "    print(f'  {sid}: {len(seq)} aa')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 9: embed phiL7 RBPs\n",
    "# 第 9 格：为 phiL7 RBP 序列生成嵌入\n",
    "rbp_emb = embed_sequences(\n",
    "    model, alphabet, rbp_seqs,\n",
    "    pooling='mean', batch_size=4,\n",
    "    model_name=MODEL_NAME,\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('Embedding shape / 嵌入形状:', rbp_emb['array'].shape)\n",
    "print('Lengths        / 序列长度 :', rbp_emb['lengths'])\n",
    "print('seq_ids        / 序列 ID  :', list(rbp_emb['seq_ids']))\n",
    "print('meta           / 元数据   :', json.dumps(json.loads(rbp_emb['meta']), indent=2))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 10: sanity assertions for phiL7 RBP embeddings\n",
    "# 第 10 格：phiL7 RBP 嵌入完整性断言\n",
    "arr = rbp_emb['array']\n",
    "N = len(rbp_seqs)\n",
    "assert arr.shape == (N, model.embed_dim), f'Shape mismatch: {arr.shape}'\n",
    "assert arr.dtype == np.float32, f'dtype: {arr.dtype}'\n",
    "assert not np.any(np.isnan(arr)), 'NaN in embeddings!'\n",
    "assert len(rbp_emb['lengths']) == N\n",
    "for i, (sid, seq) in enumerate(rbp_seqs):\n",
    "    assert rbp_emb['lengths'][i] == len(seq), f'lengths[{i}] mismatch'\n",
    "print('All assertions passed / 所有断言通过 ✓')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 11 (was Step 1 cell 10): save phiL7 RBP embeddings\n",
    "# 第 11 格：保存 phiL7 RBP 嵌入\n",
    "OUT_RBP = MODULE_DIR / 'outputs' / f'embeddings_{MODEL_NAME}_phiL7_rbps.npz'\n",
    "save_npz(OUT_RBP, rbp_emb)\n",
    "print('Saved to:', OUT_RBP)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 12: determinism check\n",
    "# 第 12 格：确定性检查（相同输入两次运行结果应完全一致）\n",
    "emb_run1 = embed_sequences(model, alphabet, rbp_seqs[:3], pooling='mean', model_name=MODEL_NAME)\n",
    "emb_run2 = embed_sequences(model, alphabet, rbp_seqs[:3], pooling='mean', model_name=MODEL_NAME)\n",
    "assert np.allclose(emb_run1['array'], emb_run2['array'], atol=1e-6), 'NOT deterministic!'\n",
    "print('Determinism check passed / 确定性检查通过 ✓')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Update embedding_index.csv and MANIFEST.csv\n",
    "\n",
    "Per INTERFACE universal conventions, every `outputs/` directory must have a `MANIFEST.csv`.\n",
    "\n",
    "按 INTERFACE 通用规范，每个 `outputs/` 目录必须包含 `MANIFEST.csv`。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 14: update embedding_index.csv\n",
    "# 第 14 格：更新 embedding_index.csv\n",
    "import hashlib\n",
    "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
    "\n",
    "idx_path = MODULE_DIR / 'outputs' / 'embedding_index.csv'\n",
    "existing = pd.read_csv(idx_path) if idx_path.exists() else pd.DataFrame()\n",
    "\n",
    "meta = json.loads(rbp_emb['meta'])\n",
    "new_rows = [{\n",
    "    'seq_id': str(sid),\n",
    "    'source_file': str(rbp_path.relative_to(REPO_ROOT)),\n",
    "    'model': meta['model'],\n",
    "    'n_residues': int(rbp_emb['lengths'][i]),\n",
    "    'embed_dim': rbp_emb['array'].shape[1],\n",
    "    'npz_file': OUT_RBP.name,\n",
    "} for i, (sid, _) in enumerate(rbp_seqs)]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Remove stale entries for same npz_file, then append\n",
    "# 删除同一 npz_file 的旧条目，再追加新条目\n",
    "if len(existing) > 0:\n",
    "    existing = existing[existing['npz_file'] != OUT_RBP.name]\n",
    "idx_df = pd.concat([existing, pd.DataFrame(new_rows)], ignore_index=True)\n",
    "idx_df.to_csv(idx_path, index=False)\n",
    "print(f'embedding_index.csv: {len(idx_df)} rows')\n",
    "idx_df"
   ]
  },
